Q.10)Apply Logistic Regression to classify smartphones into different price categories using the given 
smartphone dataset. Preprocess the data appropriately and assess the model using Accuracy, F1-
Score, and Confusion matrix



data = {
    "RAM": [2, 3, 4, 4, 6, 6, 8, 8, 12, 12, 16, 16],
    "Storage": [32, 64, 64, 128, 128, 256, 128, 256, 256, 512, 256, 512],
    "Battery": [3000, 3500, 4000, 4500, 4500, 5000, 5000, 5500, 5000, 6000, 5500, 6000],
